{"id":"5e5ab7fce1b232e4","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-church-kleene-ordinal.md","title":"递归关系秩与 Church–Kleene 序数","display":"df-church-kleene-ordinal — 递归关系秩与 Church–Kleene 序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-church-kleene-ordinal"],"display":"df-church-kleene-ordinal — 递归关系秩与 Church–Kleene 序数","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 3.2.9","source_pages":"25","source_pdf_pages":"35","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-church-kleene-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-church-kleene-ordinal — 递归关系秩与 Church–Kleene 序数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.2.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"25"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"35"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\">\\(\\chi_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{field}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{field}(R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\)</span> 在下式定义；只对良基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 定义秩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 为下式定义的序数；序数后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}\">\\(\\operatorname{succ}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R,\\\\0&amp;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\qquad(x,y&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_R(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R,\\\\0&amp;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\qquad(x,y&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\mid\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\mid\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{field}(R)\\coloneqq\\{x&lt;\\omega\\mid\\exists y&lt;\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{field}(R)\\coloneqq\\{x&lt;\\omega\\mid\\exists y&lt;\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{field}(R)\\;\n(U\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\neg \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{field}(R)\\;\n(U\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\neg \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(y))\\mid \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rk}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(y))\\mid \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(x))\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(x))\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\mid\nR\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\mid\nR\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 3.2.9。原书紧承“良基关系”语境，sup 的文字式省略该前提；这里显式恢复，避免对非良基 PR 关系调用未定义的序型。原书此处 otyp 是一般良基关系秩，不仅线性良序的同构型；线性情形两者一致。良基递归给出唯一秩；PR 关系是可数的集合族，所有所取秩是序数，故该上确界为集合序数。新增前已查本书063：它涉及可容许序数，不能替代 CK 精确接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]