{18}_2\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\mid\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{field}(R)\\coloneqq\\{x<\\omega\\mid\\exists y<\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\forall U\\subseteq\\operatorname{field}(R)\\;\n(U\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\neg \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rk}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(y))\\mid \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{succ}(\\operatorname{rk}_R(x))\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathrm{WF}(R)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\operatorname{otyp}(R)\\mid\nR\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}^{18}_2\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2538,"backlinks":[{"id":"c8f3a8371faa8691","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(R)$、$\\operatorname{field}(R)$ 和良基关系的 $\\operatorname{otyp}(R)$ 精确复用 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]；这里不要求 $R$ 原始递归。次序关系采用该书的严格传递关系口径，序型仍为一般良基关系秩，不要求线性。$\\mathrm{TI}_H(X)$ 是下式给出的闭数变量、含一个自由集参数的具体公式代码。$\\beta^*$、$\\mathrm{AutClosed}_\\alpha(B)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Aut}(\\alpha)$ 都由 Assertion 定义；$B$ 在 $\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)$ 中取值。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]"},{"id":"2053b1b724a60f4e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRTerm}_2,\\operatorname{ev}$ 见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]，$\\operatorname{otyp}(R)$ 与 $\\mathrm{WF}(R)$ 见 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]；它们采用一般良基关系秩，不擅自增加线性假设。$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 见 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$\\mathrm{tc}$ 见 [[18-df-truth-complexity]]。$R_a(s,t)$、$\\mathrm{Prog}$、$\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathbb N}$ 是 Tait 公式构造；$\\to$ 按 $\\sim A\\lor B$ 展开。源数变量枚举 $x_i$ 取同一 Tait 语言节点。下式两个归纳模板的绑定变量固定为 $x_0,x_1$，不再从任意不同变量中另作选择；$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$X\\in\\mathcal X$ 为自由一元参数；$\\overline1$ 是源语言数码。"},{"id":"fdadd493aba9167e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$V^\\alpha$ 取 [[18-df-verification-calculus]]，$\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 取 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]。$F^\\nabla$ 在有限公式树上递归，收集顶层析取分支。$\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)$ 取 [[18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]；前者包含全部自由集合变量的所有无重复全称闭包，后者是按固定枚举选取的代表。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","dbde69396a089d39","f04544345afa1f92"]}